/* 📘 Notes
Border Syntax
border: width style color;

Example:

border:2px solid red;
Border Width
border-width:5px;
Border Style
border-style:solid;

Other styles:

solid
dashed
dotted
double
groove
ridge
inset
outset
none
Border Color
border-color:blue;
Border Radius

Rounded corners banane ke liye:

border-radius:20px;

Circle banane ke liye:

border-radius:50%; */